{"parents":[{"StatuteId":2048328,"Type":"Title","Statute":"23A"},{"StatuteId":2048622,"Type":"Chapter","Statute":"17"}],"Previous":"23A-16-18","Next":"23A-17-1","StatuteId":2048622,"Statute":"23A-17","Type":"Chapter","CatchLine":"TRANSFER OF PROCEEDINGS FROM COUNTY ","FilePath":null,"FileName":null,"Htmlpath":null,"Htmlfilename":null,"Title":23,"TitleLetter":"A","Chapter":17,"ChapterLetter":null,"Section":0,"SubSec":0,"SubSection":null,"Word":null,"Html":"                                                                   \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<title>23A-17 TRANSFER OF PROCEEDINGS FROM COUNTY </title>\r\n<meta name=\"Keywords\" content=\"South Dakota Codified Laws SDCL 23A-17 TRANSFER OF PROCEEDINGS FROM COUNTY \">\r\n<meta name=\"Description\" content=\"South Dakota Codified Laws 23A-17\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- File converted by Wp2Html Version 4.0  -->\r\n<!-- Email Andrew@brackenbeds.co.uk for more details  -->\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: System_34 --><!-- WP Style End: System_34 -->\r\n<div align=\"full\">\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: HG4 --><div align=\"center\"><!-- WP Style End: HG4 -->\r\nCHAPTER 23A-17\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: HG4 --><!-- WP Style End: HG4 -->\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: HG4C --><div align=\"center\"><!-- WP Style End: HG4C -->\r\nTRANSFER OF PROCEEDINGS FROM COUNTY\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: HG4C --><!-- WP Style End: HG4C -->\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-1\">23A-17-1</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 20(a)) Consent by defendant to waive trial and accept disposition in county where\r\narrested or held--Approval by prosecuting attorneys--Transmittal of papers.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-2\">23A-17-2</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 20(b)) Reserved.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-3\">23A-17-3</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 20(c)) Return of papers to original county when defendant pleads not guilty.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-4\">23A-17-4</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 20(d)) Reserved.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-5\">23A-17-5</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 21(a)) Change of county when fair trial impossible in original county.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-6\">23A-17-6</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 21(b)) Change of county for convenience on consent of parties.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-7\">23A-17-7</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 21(c)) Transmittal of papers on change of counties.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-8\">23A-17-8</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\n(Rule 22) Time for motion to transfer.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: B --><!-- WP Style End: B -->\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/statutes/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&Statute=23A-17-9\">23A-17-9</a>\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: IN -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: IN -->\r\nCosts and fees on transferred case paid by original county.<p>\r\n</p></div></div></body>\r\n</html>\r\n<hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048613Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048613SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048613CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048613Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048613DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048613000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048613SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048613SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048613Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-17-1\"><span class=\"s2048613SENU\">23A-17-1</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048613SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048613CL\">(Rule 20(a)) Consent by defendant to waive trial and accept disposition in county where arrested or held--Approval by prosecuting attorneys--Transmittal of papers.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048613Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2048613DefaultParagraphFont\">A defendant arrested, held, or present in a county other than that in which the indictment, information, or complaint is pending against him may state in writing that he wishes to plead guilty or nolo contendere, to waive trial in the county in which the indictment, information, or complaint is pending and to consent to disposition of the case in the county in which he was arrested, is held, or is present, subject to the approval of the prosecuting attorney for each county. Upon receipt of the defendant's statement and of the written approval of the prosecuting attorney, the clerk of the court or the court in which the indictment, information, or complaint is pending shall transmit the papers in the proceeding or certified copies thereof to the clerk of the court or court for the county in which the defendant is held and the prosecution shall continue in that county.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048613Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048613000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048613Normal\"><span class=\"s2048613SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048613SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 221.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br>                                                                   \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<title>23A-17-2 </title>\r\n<meta name=\"Keywords\" content=\"South Dakota Codified Laws SDCL 23A-17-2 \">\r\n<meta name=\"Description\" content=\"South Dakota Codified Laws 23A-17-2\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- File converted by Wp2Html Version 4.0  -->\r\n<!-- Email Andrew@brackenbeds.co.uk for more details  -->\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: System_34 --><!-- WP Style End: System_34 -->\r\n<div align=\"full\">\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: SENU -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: SENU -->\r\n23A-17-2.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: SENU -->&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: SENU -->\r\n(Rule 20(b)) Reserved<p>\r\n</p></div></div></body>\r\n</html>\r\n<hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048615Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048615SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048615CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048615Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048615DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048615000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048615SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048615SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048615Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-17-3\"><span class=\"s2048615SENU\">23A-17-3</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048615SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048615CL\">(Rule 20(c)) Return of papers to original county when defendant pleads not guilty.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048615Normal-000000\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048615DefaultParagraphFont\">If, after the proceeding has been transferred pursuant to § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-17-1\"><span class=\"s2048615DefaultParagraphFont\">23A-17-1</span></a><span class=\"s2048615DefaultParagraphFont\">, the defendant pleads not guilty, the clerk of the court or the court shall return the papers to the court in which the prosecution was commenced and the proceeding shall be restored to the docket of that court. The defendant's statement that he wishes to plead guilty or nolo contendere shall not be used against him without his consent.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048615Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048615000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048615Normal\"><span class=\"s2048615SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048615SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 223.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br>                                                                   \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n                                                                          \r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<title>23A-17-4 </title>\r\n<meta name=\"Keywords\" content=\"South Dakota Codified Laws SDCL 23A-17-4 \">\r\n<meta name=\"Description\" content=\"South Dakota Codified Laws 23A-17-4\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- File converted by Wp2Html Version 4.0  -->\r\n<!-- Email Andrew@brackenbeds.co.uk for more details  -->\r\n\r\n<!-- WP Style Open: System_34 --><!-- WP Style End: System_34 -->\r\n<div align=\"full\">\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style On: SENU -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: SENU -->\r\n23A-17-4.\r\n<!-- WP Paired Style Off: SENU -->&nbsp;<!-- WP Style End: SENU -->\r\n(Rule 20(d)) Reserved<p>\r\n</p></div></div></body>\r\n</html>\r\n<hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048617Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048617SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048617CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048617Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048617DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048617000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048617SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048617SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048617Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-17-5\"><span class=\"s2048617SENU\">23A-17-5</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048617SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048617CL\">(Rule 21(a)) Change of county when fair trial impossible in original county.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048617Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2048617DefaultParagraphFont\">A court upon motion of a defendant shall transfer his proceedings to another county if the court is satisfied that there exists, in the county where the prosecution is pending, so great a prejudice against the defendant that he cannot obtain a fair and impartial trial at any place fixed by law for holding court in that county.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048617Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048617000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048617Normal\"><span class=\"s2048617SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048617SCL-000002\">  SDC 1939 &amp; Supp 1960, § 34.0817; SDCL, § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23-28-7\"><span class=\"s2048617SCL-000002\">23-28-7</span></a><span class=\"s2048617SCL-000002\"><span>; <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 225.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048618Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048618SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048618CL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\np.s2048618Normal-000000 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.50in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048618DefaultParagraphFont {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048618000001 {\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048618SCL {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048618SCL-000002 {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif'; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1;\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048618Normal\"><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes/Codified_Laws/DisplayStatute.aspx?Type=Statute&amp;Statute=23A-17-6\"><span class=\"s2048618SENU\">23A-17-6</span></a><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048618SENU\">. </span><span class=\"s2048618CL\">(Rule 21(b)) Change of county for convenience on consent of parties.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048618Normal-000000\"><span class=\"s2048618DefaultParagraphFont\">Upon the consent of both parties and for the convenience of parties and witnesses, and in the interest of justice, a court may transfer proceedings or any one or more of the counts thereof to another county.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048618Normal\"><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048618000001\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s2048618Normal\"><span class=\"s2048618SCL\">Source:</span><span xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s2048618SCL-000002\"><span>  <a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"/api/SessionLaws/1978/178/null/null\" aria-label=\"SL 1978, ch 178\">SL 1978, ch 178</a>, § 226.</span></span></p></div></div></body></html><hr><br><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\"><style>span { white-space: pre-wrap; }\r\np.s2048619Normal {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s2048619SENU {\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight